      "title": "NOTES",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# MODELS AND NODES USED IN THIS WORKFLOW  \n\n---\n\n## 🟣 Load Diffusion Model\n### Download the model **flux-2-klein-9b-fp8mixed.safetensors (distilled)** ~9.4GB from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/silveroxides/FLUX.2-dev-fp8_scaled/resolve/main/flux-2-klein-9b-fp8mixed.safetensors)\n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/flux2` \n\nCreate the `flux2` folder if it does not exist)\n \n---\n\n## 🟣 Load CLIP\n\n###  Download **qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors**  from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-klein-9B/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors)\n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders`  \n\n--- \n\n## 🟣 Load VAE\n\n### Download the **flux2-vae** from [HERE](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors)  \n\n📁 **Place in:** `ComfyUI/models/vae`  \n\n---\n\n\n"
